# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ONNX model weights
#
# Real weights are fetched at run time into the user's cache and must never enter the repository. The
# rule targets the weight files themselves rather than any directory called "models" — an earlier
# `models/` pattern also matched src/EasyImageSharp.AI/Models/, which holds source code, and silently
# excluded it from the repository (git matches ignore patterns case-insensitively on Windows).
#
# The synthetic stubs under tests/EasyImageSharp.AI.Tests/Models/ are committed on purpose: they are a
# few hundred bytes each and the AI test suite has to run offline.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.onnx
*.onnx.data
!tests/EasyImageSharp.AI.Tests/Models/*.onnx

